  "project_description": "This module add a token to answer the need of extracting an image URL out of the body field. This is useful in the case you have a page with a single body field and you want to setup an image in the meta tags in order to improve the sharing experience in social media or search engines.\n\n Features \n - Add a new token [node:body_image_url]\n\n Post-Installation \n - Install the module\n\n- Use [node:body_image_url] wherever tokens are allowed with a node context like in the meta tags.\n\n Back to top",
